    "title": "Red Flag Warning by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Check NWS updates here The National Weather Service in Elko has extended the Red Flag Warning, which is in effect until 11 PM PDT this evening. * WIND...Sustained southwest to west winds near 20 mph, with gusts near 35 mph. * HUMIDITY...Relative humidity values as low as 5 percent. * IMPACTS...Any fires that develop will likely spread rapidly. Outdoor burning is not recommended.",
